1
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:44,400
Mom...

2
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,920
You're finally quiet.

3
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:43,400
Sir, just pull over up ahead.

4
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,159
Thank you, Sir.

5
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:12,439
See you.

6
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:21,959
Do you think you can get away?

7
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,839
You claimed your mother took the train back,

8
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:29,639
but there's no record of any ticket purchase.

9
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,160
That means she's still in the city.

10
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:39,199
Your brother soon realized she was missing.

11
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,480
He probably went to the police.

12
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,839
And the last time...

13
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:42,920
Just shut up!

14
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:14,279
Sis, open the door!

15
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:15,759
Sis!

16
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,199
Open up!

17
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,720
The police need to talk to you!

18
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,319
Sis!

19
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,360
Open the door!

20
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,600
Sis!

21
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,160
What are you doing in there?

22
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:32,120
Sis!

23
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,360
Mom is missing!

24
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,360
Hurry and open up!

25
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,600
Sis!

26
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:41,200
Did you hear me?

27
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,679
Sis!

28
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,519
Open the door!

29
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,120
Sis!

30
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,440
Sis!

31
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:00,720
Do you hear me?

32
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,600
Sis, Mom is missing!

33
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,200
Are you Zhang Xiaomin?

34
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,240
Yes, that's me.

35
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:18,080
We're from the police department.

36
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,320
We received a report,

37
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,159
and need your assistance with an investigation.

38
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,519
Please come with us.

39
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,120
Zhang Xiaomin, this is the search warrant.

40
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:41,919
Please verify it.

41
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,080
Zhang Xiaomin,

42
00:10:24,639 --> 00:10:25,559
do you know what we found

43
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:26,759
in your home?

44
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:33,679
The quilts and blankets in your closet are gone.

45
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:36,080
The shower curtain is missing, too.

46
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,840
The floor was mopped spotless.

47
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,480
But...

48
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:41,240
we found traces of blood

49
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,200
in the bend of your toilet's drainpipe.

50
00:10:43,759 --> 00:10:45,360
That blood belongs to your mother.

51
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,159
According to your story,

52
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:50,240
after your mother argued with you,

53
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,320
she went back to her hometown.

54
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,000
But these bloodstains...

55
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,639
how do you explain them?

56
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,200
You're working at a law firm

57
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,720
as a paralegal, right?

58
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,399
Since you studied law,

59
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,559
let's not beat around the bush.

60
00:11:07,519 --> 00:11:09,399
You know what dismemberment means.

61
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:12,159
The site where the body parts were found

62
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:13,600
was a construction site in the east suburbs.

63
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,679
Two construction workers

64
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,200
on their way home

65
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,600
saw a pack of dogs digging in the dirt.

66
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,080
When they walked over,

67
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,399
they found human remains.

68
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:24,039
Inside the box containing the remains,

69
00:11:24,039 --> 00:11:25,519
a bloody knife was found.

70
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:27,919
Testing found your fingerprints on it.

71
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,159
These are photos from the crime scene.

72
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,039
From the body parts dug up from the dirt,

73
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:34,840
our DNA testing

74
00:11:35,159 --> 00:11:36,120
confirmed that the victim

75
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,000
was a 50-year-old woman,

76
00:11:38,559 --> 00:11:40,480
recovering from breast cancer surgery.

77
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:42,919
At noon today,

78
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:44,039
a young man went

79
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:45,360
to the local police substation to report

80
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:46,960
that his mother was missing.

81
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,840
She was recovering from cancer surgery.

82
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:52,600
They spoke on the phone every day,

83
00:11:53,039 --> 00:11:54,919
but today, he suddenly couldn't reach her.

84
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:57,399
And that young man who reported it

85
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:59,960
happens to be your younger brother, Zhang Xiaoqiang.

86
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:01,879
We also questioned your neighbors.

87
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:03,519
They all said

88
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,639
your relationship with your mother was terrible,

89
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,799
and that you often fought fiercely.

90
00:12:08,679 --> 00:12:10,159
In those arguments, you'd even say things like,

91
00:12:10,159 --> 00:12:12,720
"I'd rather be dead,"

92
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,039
"Leave me alone,"

93
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:17,080
and "I don't want to be your tool."

94
00:12:17,799 --> 00:12:20,519
And on the night of the crime,

95
00:12:20,559 --> 00:12:21,559
your neighbors said

96
00:12:21,639 --> 00:12:23,200
there was constant noise from your place,

97
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,120
persistent sounds

98
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:26,360
that went on until around 2:00 a.m.

99
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:28,559
Footsteps pacing back and forth, too.

100
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,679
How do you explain that?

101
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:35,320
The rarest thing in this world...

102
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:38,559
is peace and quiet.

103
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:41,879
What do you mean?

104
00:12:44,279 --> 00:12:46,039
Parents can choose their children,

105
00:12:48,679 --> 00:12:51,519
but children can never choose their parents.

106
00:13:37,559 --> 00:13:38,840
Nine yuan in total.

107
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:54,840
Xiaomin.

108
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:57,240
The verdict from the first trial is coming out soon.

109
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,159
Right now, the best outcome...

110
00:13:59,639 --> 00:14:00,440
might be...

111
00:14:00,919 --> 00:14:01,600
life imprisonment.

112
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,440
I'd rather just get the death penalty.

113
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:06,480
Zhang Xiaomin!

114
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,720
Do you have any idea what you're saying?

115
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,720
Of course I do.

116
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,639
Xiaomin! Xiaomin!

117
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:15,320
Is anyone there? The prisoner is suffocating!

118
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:16,440
Anyone there?

119
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,919
Tomorrow at 11:13 a.m.,

120
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,759
your in-laws will die in a car crash.

121
00:15:15,759 --> 00:15:17,120
Your husband's family is very superstitious.

122
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,799
Ever since their son married you,

123
00:15:20,799 --> 00:15:22,440
he's had nothing but bad luck these past few years.

124
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,240
Behind closed doors, they all say

125
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,360
your failure to conceive

126
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,399
is jinxing the family fortune.

127
00:15:30,639 --> 00:15:33,600
Tomorrow, they'll badger you into going to a temple

128
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,720
to burn incense and pray for a baby.

129
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:37,480
On the drive back,

130
00:15:38,639 --> 00:15:40,120
your mother-in-law will nag you.

131
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,279
You'll get upset,

132
00:15:43,279 --> 00:15:45,159
pull over to the side of the road and get out.

133
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,440
That's when tragedy will strike.

134
00:15:48,519 --> 00:15:49,279
I'm Fu Ting,

135
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,279
a lawyer.

136
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,919
Though I don't know exactly why,

137
00:15:58,480 --> 00:16:00,360
I've entered your consciousness.

138
00:16:02,799 --> 00:16:04,480
Your consciousness seems quite unique.

139
00:16:06,799 --> 00:16:09,399
Xiaona, I don't mean to criticize,

140
00:16:09,399 --> 00:16:11,720
but look at Xiao Li next door.

141
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,759
She's years younger than Jianguo,

142
00:16:13,759 --> 00:16:16,519
yet she already has two kids.

143
00:16:16,519 --> 00:16:17,919
A boy

144
00:16:17,919 --> 00:16:19,120
and a girl.

145
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:20,399
Just perfect.

146
00:16:20,759 --> 00:16:22,279
They make a perfect pair.

147
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,120
That's true.

148
00:16:25,519 --> 00:16:27,039
Why don't we look into other options?

149
00:16:27,759 --> 00:16:29,159
Technology is so advanced these days, after all.

150
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,240
It's still better to let nature take its course.

151
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,919
We should just let things happen naturally.

152
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:36,159
We'll definitely have a child in time.

153
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:36,799
Mom,

154
00:16:37,039 --> 00:16:39,000
I'm going to use the restroom in the village up ahead.
